Commercial use needs permission first
-------------------------------------

Using Stepwright in the course of running a business is commercial use, and it
is not covered by the licence below. That includes, and is not limited to,
using it inside a company to write its own documentation, using it to produce
guides for customers, and bundling it with a paid service.

Permission for commercial use is given by the copyright holder, and is often
given freely. Ask for it by writing to:

    aierfate.aierken@gmail.com

Say who you are, what you would use it for, and roughly how many people would
use it. A written reply granting permission is what makes that use licensed;
nothing else on this page grants it.

Personal use, learning, evaluation, research and charitable use are covered by
the licence below and need no permission at all.

